msgstr "Pred exportom vypočítajte nepodané priznanie."

#. module: l10n_sk_vehicle_tax
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_sk_vehicle_tax.selection__l10n_sk_vehicle_tax_return__state__preview
